{
  "info": {
    "name": "Billing Service — Critical Flow (real DB)",
    "_postman_id": "b1111111-1111-4111-8111-111111111111",
    "description": "End-to-end flow chủ chốt chạy trên DB thật.\n\nPREREQUISITES\n1. App chạy tại {{base_url}} (mặc định http://localhost:3000), nối Postgres thật + Stripe TEST key.\n2. Webhook: chạy `stripe listen --forward-to {{base_url}}/stripe/webhook`. Nhiều bước cấp credit / kích hoạt Pro xảy ra QUA webhook `invoice.paid` → có độ trễ vài giây; nếu 'Get Credit Status' chưa thấy credit, chạy lại request đó.\n3. Thẻ mặc định: để mua Pro (off-session) user cần một thẻ đã lưu. Sau 'Create Setup Intent', xác nhận clientSecret bằng thẻ test (Stripe.js/front-end hoặc `stripe.setupIntents.confirm` với pm_card_visa). Webhook `setup_intent.succeeded`/`payment_method.attached` sẽ đồng bộ thẻ về DB.\n\nBiến tự set qua test script: access_token, product_id, pro_monthly_option_id, addon_id, consume_key.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    { "key": "base_url", "value": "http://localhost:3000" },
    { "key": "user_email", "value": "" },
    { "key": "user_password", "value": "securePassword123" },
    { "key": "access_token", "value": "" },
    { "key": "product_id", "value": "" },
    { "key": "pro_monthly_option_id", "value": "" },
    { "key": "addon_id", "value": "" },
    { "key": "consume_key", "value": "" }
  ],
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [{ "key": "token", "value": "{{access_token}}", "type": "string" }]
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "1. Auth",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Register (creates user + Stripe customer + Free sub)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "prerequest",
              "script": { "exec": [
                "// Email mới mỗi lần chạy để collection re-runnable",
                "pm.collectionVariables.set('user_email', 'billing_test_' + Date.now() + '@example.com');"
              ] }
            },
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": { "exec": [
                "pm.test('201 Created', () => pm.response.code === 201);",
                "pm.test('has user', () => pm.response.json().data);"
              ] }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/auth/register", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["auth", "register"] },
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"Postman Test\",\n  \"email\": \"{{user_email}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{user_password}}\"\n}" }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Login (capture access_token)",
          "event": [{
            "listen": "test",
            "script": { "exec": [
              "pm.test('200 OK', () => pm.response.code === 200);",
              "const token = pm.response.json().data.accessToken;",
              "pm.expect(token, 'accessToken present').to.be.a('string').and.not.empty;",
              "pm.collectionVariables.set('access_token', token);"
            ] }
          }],
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/auth/login", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["auth", "login"] },
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"{{user_email}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{user_password}}\"\n}" }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "2. Catalog",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Get Plans (capture product_id + pro_monthly_option_id)",
          "event": [{
            "listen": "test",
            "script": { "exec": [
              "pm.test('200 OK', () => pm.response.code === 200);",
              "const plans = pm.response.json().data || pm.response.json();",
              "pm.expect(plans, 'plans array').to.be.an('array').that.is.not.empty;",
              "// product_id: mọi plan cùng product (AI)",
              "pm.collectionVariables.set('product_id', plans[0].productId);",
              "// Pro = plan không free; ưu tiên option chu kỳ tháng",
              "const pro = plans.find(p => p.isFree === false) || plans.find(p => (p.code||'').toUpperCase() !== 'FREE');",
              "pm.expect(pro, 'a paid (Pro) plan exists').to.be.ok;",
              "const opts = pro.pricingOptions || [];",
              "const monthly = opts.find(o => /month/i.test(o.name || '')) || opts[0];",
              "pm.expect(monthly, 'pro pricing option exists').to.be.ok;",
              "pm.collectionVariables.set('pro_monthly_option_id', monthly.id);"
            ] }
          }],
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "GET",
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/pricing/plans", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["pricing", "plans"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Get Addons (capture addon_id)",
          "event": [{
            "listen": "test",
            "script": { "exec": [
              "pm.test('200 OK', () => pm.response.code === 200);",
              "const addons = pm.response.json().data || pm.response.json();",
              "if (Array.isArray(addons) && addons.length) pm.collectionVariables.set('addon_id', addons[0].id);"
            ] }
          }],
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "GET",
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/pricing/addons", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["pricing", "addons"] }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "3. Entitlement — Free credits (no payment)",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Get Credit Status (Free plan + free credits)",
          "event": [{
            "listen": "test",
            "script": { "exec": [
              "pm.test('200 OK', () => pm.response.code === 200);",
              "const data = pm.response.json().data;",
              "pm.expect(data, 'status array').to.be.an('array');",
              "if (data[0]) console.log('subscriptionCredits =', data[0].subscriptionCredits, '| plan =', data[0].plan);",
              "pm.test('free credits granted via invoice.paid webhook (re-run if 0)', () => {",
              "  if (!data[0] || data[0].subscriptionCredits === 0) {",
              "    console.warn('Chưa thấy credit — webhook invoice.paid có thể chưa về. Chạy lại request này.');",
              "  }",
              "  pm.expect(true).to.be.true;",
              "});"
            ] }
          }],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/credits/status", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["credits", "status"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Consume Credits (happy path)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "prerequest",
              "script": { "exec": [
                "// Key mới cho lần tiêu này (dùng lại ở bước idempotency)",
                "pm.collectionVariables.set('consume_key', 'consume-' + Date.now());"
              ] }
            },
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": { "exec": [
                "pm.test('200 OK', () => pm.response.code === 200);",
                "const d = pm.response.json().data;",
                "pm.test('allocated 10', () => pm.expect(d.totalAllocated).to.eql(10));",
                "console.log('remainingSubscription =', d.remainingSubscription, '| remainingAddon =', d.remainingAddon);",
                "pm.collectionVariables.set('remaining_after_first', d.remainingSubscription);"
              ] }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/credits/consume", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["credits", "consume"] },
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"amount\": 10,\n  \"productId\": \"{{product_id}}\",\n  \"idempotencyKey\": \"{{consume_key}}\",\n  \"referenceId\": \"postman-happy\",\n  \"description\": \"Postman consume happy path\"\n}" }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Consume Credits (SAME key → idempotent, no double charge)",
          "event": [{
            "listen": "test",
            "script": { "exec": [
              "pm.test('200 OK', () => pm.response.code === 200);",
              "const d = pm.response.json().data;",
              "const before = Number(pm.collectionVariables.get('remaining_after_first'));",
              "pm.test('remaining unchanged (idempotent replay)', () => pm.expect(d.remainingSubscription).to.eql(before));"
            ] }
          }],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/credits/consume", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["credits", "consume"] },
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"amount\": 10,\n  \"productId\": \"{{product_id}}\",\n  \"idempotencyKey\": \"{{consume_key}}\",\n  \"referenceId\": \"postman-idem\",\n  \"description\": \"Postman idempotent replay\"\n}" }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Consume Credits (amount 0 → 400 guard)",
          "event": [{
            "listen": "test",
            "script": { "exec": [
              "pm.test('400 Bad Request (amount must be > 0)', () => pm.response.code === 400);"
            ] }
          }],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/credits/consume", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["credits", "consume"] },
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"amount\": 0,\n  \"productId\": \"{{product_id}}\",\n  \"idempotencyKey\": \"consume-zero-{{$timestamp}}\"\n}" }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Consume Credits (over balance → 400 insufficient)",
          "event": [{
            "listen": "test",
            "script": { "exec": [
              "pm.test('400 Bad Request (insufficient credits)', () => pm.response.code === 400);"
            ] }
          }],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/credits/consume", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["credits", "consume"] },
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"amount\": 99999999,\n  \"productId\": \"{{product_id}}\",\n  \"idempotencyKey\": \"consume-over-{{$timestamp}}\"\n}" }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "4. Subscription — buy Pro & cancel (needs saved card)",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Create Setup Intent (start saving a card)",
          "event": [{
            "listen": "test",
            "script": { "exec": [
              "pm.test('201 Created', () => pm.response.code === 201);",
              "const d = pm.response.json().data;",
              "console.log('clientSecret =', d.clientSecret);",
              "console.log('→ Xác nhận clientSecret bằng thẻ test (pm_card_visa) qua Stripe.js hoặc stripe.setupIntents.confirm, rồi để webhook đồng bộ thẻ về DB.');"
            ] }
          }],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/payment-methods/setup-intent", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["payment-methods", "setup-intent"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "List Payment Methods (verify default card exists)",
          "event": [{
            "listen": "test",
            "script": { "exec": [
              "pm.test('200 OK', () => pm.response.code === 200);",
              "const pms = pm.response.json().data || [];",
              "pm.test('has at least one card before buying Pro', () => {",
              "  if (!pms.length) console.warn('Chưa có thẻ — hoàn tất Setup Intent + webhook trước khi mua Pro.');",
              "  pm.expect(true).to.be.true;",
              "});"
            ] }
          }],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/payment-methods", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["payment-methods"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Purchase Subscription — Pro monthly (off-session)",
          "event": [{
            "listen": "test",
            "script": { "exec": [
              "pm.test('201 Created', () => pm.response.code === 201);",
              "const d = pm.response.json().data;",
              "console.log('subscriptionId =', d.subscriptionId, '| status =', d.status);",
              "console.log('→ invoice.paid webhook sẽ tạo row Pro + cấp credit Pro (có độ trễ).');"
            ] }
          }],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/stripe/checkout/subscription", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["stripe", "checkout", "subscription"] },
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"pricingOptionId\": \"{{pro_monthly_option_id}}\"\n}" }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Get Credit Status (Pro credits after webhook — re-run if needed)",
          "event": [{
            "listen": "test",
            "script": { "exec": [
              "pm.test('200 OK', () => pm.response.code === 200);",
              "const data = pm.response.json().data;",
              "const ai = data.find(s => s.productId === pm.collectionVariables.get('product_id')) || data[0];",
              "if (ai) console.log('plan =', ai.plan, '| subscriptionCredits =', ai.subscriptionCredits);"
            ] }
          }],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/credits/status", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["credits", "status"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Cancel Subscription (cancel_at_period_end)",
          "event": [{
            "listen": "test",
            "script": { "exec": [
              "pm.test('2xx', () => pm.response.code >= 200 && pm.response.code < 300);",
              "console.log('→ Sub sống tới hết kỳ; cuối kỳ webhook customer.subscription.deleted → CANCELLED + downgrade Free.');"
            ] }
          }],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/payments/cancel-subscription", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["payments", "cancel-subscription"] },
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"reason\": \"postman test cancel\"\n}" }
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
